  "description": "Candidate libraries for a comparative panel of the NB01 dsRNase-3 transcript-evidence command. This file is a CATALOGUE OF METADATA AND ITS SOURCES, not a panel and not an attribution: it declares which public RNA-seq runs exist, what their records say, and what remains unlinked. It carries no alignment, no hash of any alignment and no claim that any run assembled the published dsRNase-3 contig. The panel the command consumes is a separate file, produced per run, that adds one materialised SAM per library with its sha256.",
